is_nonzero(input) -> (bool)

Returns True if the :attr:`input` is a single element tensor which is not equal to zero
after type conversions.
i.e. not equal to ``torch.tensor([0.])`` or ``torch.tensor([0])`` or
``torch.tensor([False])``.
